/-!
# A097352

Rectangular array T(n,k) by antidiagonals; rows are generalized Fibonacci sequences and every pair (i,j) satisfying 1 <= i < j occurs exactly once.

The 80 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A097352

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 3, 4, 2, 1,
    5, 7, 4, 4, 1, 8, 11, 6, 5, 5,
    3, 13, 18, 10, 9, 6, 3, 1, 21, 29,
    16, 14, 11, 6, 6, 2, 34, 47, 26, 23,
